{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Biodome Mystery</i> is a psychological thriller where memories distort reality, and every photo hides a deeper truth. Navigate a decaying research facility with only a malfunctioning tablet and fragments of the past to guide you, as you investigate a tragedy lost to time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695290/extras/AnalyzerSteam.gif?t=1750722716\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trapped inside an abandoned biodome in the heart of the Amazon desert, you search for the truth behind a long-forgotten crime. As strange visions pull you deeper into the past, one question begins to haunt you: Why does this feel so personal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695290/extras/VisionsSteam.gif?t=1750722716\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcf7 <strong>Photos That Reveal the Past</strong> \u2013 Use a high-tech photo analyzer to uncover hidden clues in forgotten photographs. Zoom, enhance, and find details the eye can\u2019t see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f <strong>Trigger Visions of the Past</strong> \u2013 Align photos with the locations they were taken to unlock immersive visions\u2014moments frozen in time, now reawakened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Uncover a Long-Buried Mystery</strong> \u2013 Follow trails of notes, evidence, and strange messages as you unravel the story one step at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcbe <strong>A Tablet That Glitches With You</strong> \u2013 What begins as a simple investigation tool slowly shifts, revealing fragments of data and truth that may be closer to your mind than you realize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Psychological Horror Without Jumpscares</strong> \u2013 Built on atmosphere, story, and slow-burn tension\u2014designed to disturb, not startle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzle-Based Exploration Across Time</strong> \u2013 Explore a space that connects the present with the past, where every clue brings you closer to something you might not want to remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695290/extras/BasementSteam.gif?t=1750722716\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you peel back the layers of time, reality itself begins to fracture. What dark secret lies at the heart of this fallen sanctuary\u2014and, more unsettling still, what does it unveil about your own identity?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3695290?t=1750722716","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695290/c207621cee3de87d3440e75b9e32ce76c9dd4a2f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750722716","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695290/634802234d65901880b4fe78ca86efe4408c7043/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750722716","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695290/634802234d65901880b4fe78ca86efe4408c7043/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750722716","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Biodome Mystery features psychological horror elements, including tense atmosphere and unsettling themes. Players will encounter mild violence and disturbing imagery as they uncover the mystery behind a murder. The game delves into themes of memory loss, guilt, and self-inflicted punishment, exploring the emotional trauma of the protagonist. While there are no explicit depictions of sexual acts or self-harm, the story contains dark, mature themes that may be disturbing to some players. Players should be prepared for unsettling visuals and an emotionally intense experience."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Biodome Mystery</i> is a psychological thriller where memories distort reality, and every photo hides a deeper truth. Navigate a decaying research facility with only a malfunctioning tablet and fragments of the past to guide you, as you investigate a tragedy lost to time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695290/extras/AnalyzerSteam.gif?t=1750722716\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trapped inside an abandoned biodome in the heart of the Amazon desert, you search for the truth behind a long-forgotten crime. As strange visions pull you deeper into the past, one question begins to haunt you: Why does this feel so personal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695290/extras/VisionsSteam.gif?t=1750722716\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcf7 <strong>Photos That Reveal the Past</strong> \u2013 Use a high-tech photo analyzer to uncover hidden clues in forgotten photographs. Zoom, enhance, and find details the eye can\u2019t see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f <strong>Trigger Visions of the Past</strong> \u2013 Align photos with the locations they were taken to unlock immersive visions\u2014moments frozen in time, now reawakened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Uncover a Long-Buried Mystery</strong> \u2013 Follow trails of notes, evidence, and strange messages as you unravel the story one step at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcbe <strong>A Tablet That Glitches With You</strong> \u2013 What begins as a simple investigation tool slowly shifts, revealing fragments of data and truth that may be closer to your mind than you realize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Psychological Horror Without Jumpscares</strong> \u2013 Built on atmosphere, story, and slow-burn tension\u2014designed to disturb, not startle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzle-Based Exploration Across Time</strong> \u2013 Explore a space that connects the present with the past, where every clue brings you closer to something you might not want to remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695290/extras/BasementSteam.gif?t=1750722716\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you peel back the layers of time, reality itself begins to fracture. What dark secret lies at the heart of this fallen sanctuary\u2014and, more unsettling still, what does it unveil about your own identity?</p>","developers":["Yakuza Pixel"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695290/6d41951575cf26d04d31b7849e7afb9d081f44f2/header.jpg?t=1750722716","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 2016+</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u